Measurement Scales\">Measurement Scales</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-structures-and-formats\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-structures-and-formats/\"><span>08</span><span data-bn=\"Structured, Semi-structured ও Unstructured Data\" data-en=\"Structured, Semi-structured, and Unstructured Data\">Structured, Semi-structured, and Unstructured Data</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-sources-and-collection\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-sources-and-collection/\"><span>09</span><span data-bn=\"Data Source ও Collection Method\" data-en=\"Data Sources and Collection Methods\">Data Sources and Collection Methods</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"population-sample-parameter-and-statistic\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/population-sample-parameter-and-statistic/\"><span>10</span><span data-bn=\"Population, Sample, Parameter ও Statistic\" data-en=\"Population, Sample, Parameter, and Statistic\">Population, Sample, Parameter, and Statistic</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"sampling-methods\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/sampling-methods/\"><span>11</span><span data-bn=\"Sampling Method\" data-en=\"Sampling Methods\">Sampling Methods</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"bias-confounding-and-error\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/bias-confounding-and-error/\"><span>12</span><span data-bn=\"Bias, Confounding ও Error\" data-en=\"Bias, Confounding, and Error\">Bias, Confounding, and Error</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-quality-dimensions\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-quality-dimensions/\"><span>13</span><span data-bn=\"Data Quality Dimension\" data-en=\"Data Quality Dimensions\">Data Quality Dimensions</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values/\"><span>14</span><span data-bn=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid ও Outlier Value\" data-en=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values\">Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"tidy-data-and-organization\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/tidy-data-and-organization/\"><span>15</span><span data-bn=\"Tidy Data ও Data Organization\" data-en=\"Tidy Data and Data Organization\">Tidy Data and Data Organization</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"frequency-tables-and-summary-views\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/frequency-tables-and-summary-views/\"><span>16</span><span data-bn=\"Frequency Table ও Summary View\" data-en=\"Frequency Tables and Summary Views\">Frequency Tables and Summary Views</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link current\" data-chapter-link=\"analytical-questions-and-metrics\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/analytical-questions-and-metrics/\"><span>17</span><span data-bn=\"Analytical Question ও Metric Definition\" data-en=\"Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics\">Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"exploratory-data-analysis-workflow\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/exploratory-data-analysis-workflow/\"><span>18</span><span data-bn=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\" data-en=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\">Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"reproducible-analysis-and-documentation\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/reproducible-analysis-and-documentation/\"><span>19</span><span data-bn=\"Reproducible Analysis ও Documentation\" data-en=\"Reproducible Analysis and Documentation\">Reproducible Analysis and Documentation</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use/\"><span>20</span><span data-bn=\"Data Ethics, Privacy ও Responsible Use\" data-en=\"Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use\">Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"mini-project-retail-data-audit\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/mini-project-retail-data-audit/\"><span>21</span><span data-bn=\"Mini Project: Retail Dataset Audit\" data-en=\"Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset\">Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a></div></nav>\n<div class=\"tutorial-sidebar-links\"><a href=\"/exercises/data-foundations/\">Exercises</a><a href=\"/quiz/data-foundations/\">Final quiz</a><a href=\"/examples/data-foundations/\">Examples</a><a href=\"/references/data-foundations/\">References</a></div>\n</aside>\n<div class=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\"></div>\n<article class=\"tutorial-content\" data-chapter=\"analytical-questions-and-metrics\" data-tutorial=\"data-foundations\">\n<header class=\"tutorial-page-header\"><div>\n<span class=\"eyebrow\" data-bn=\"Data Foundations · Chapter 17 / 21\" data-en=\"Data Foundations · Chapter 17 of 21\">Data Foundations · Chapter 17 of 21</span>\n<h1 data-bn=\"Analytical Question ও Metric Definition\" data-en=\"Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics\">Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics</h1>\n<p class=\"tutorial-lead\" data-bn=\"Decision need-কে answerable question ও precisely defined metric-এ রূপ দিন। Grain, numerator, denominator, time window, filter, comparison ও ownership শিখুন।\" data-en=\"Turn a decision need into answerable questions and precisely defined metrics. Learn grain, numerator, denominator, time window, filters, comparison, and ownership.\">Turn a decision need into answerable questions and precisely defined metrics. Learn grain, numerator, denominator, time window, filters, comparison, and ownership.</p>\n</div><div class=\"tutorial-header-actions\"><button class=\"button ghost tutorial-drawer-open\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-open\" type=\"button\">☰ <span data-bn=\"Chapter\" data-en=\"Chapters\">Chapters</span></button><button class=\"button ghost\" onclick=\"window.print()\" type=\"button\">⎙ <span data-bn=\"Print\" data-en=\"Print\">Print</span></button></div></header>\n<div class=\"chapter-meta\"><span>◷ 50 min</span><span>Beginner</span><button class=\"button small primary\" id=\"chapter-complete\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav aria-label=\"On this chapter\" class=\"chapter-jump\"><a href=\"#objectives\">Objectives</a><a href=\"#concept-1\">Learn</a><a href=\"#worked-example\">Example</a><a href=\"#try-it\">Try it</a><a href=\"#exercises\">Exercises</a><a href=\"#summary\">Summary</a></nav>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section tutorial-objectives\" id=\"objectives\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Start here</div><h2 data-bn=\"আপনি যা শিখবেন\" data-en=\"What you will learn\">What you will learn</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"Decision-কে analytical question-এ translate করুন।\" data-en=\"Translate a decision into analytical questions.\">Translate a decision into analytical questions.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Complete business logic-সহ metric define করুন।\" data-en=\"Define metrics with complete business logic.\">Define metrics with complete business logic.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Output, outcome ও driver আলাদা করুন।\" data-en=\"Separate outputs, outcomes, and drivers.\">Separate outputs, outcomes, and drivers.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Denominator ও grain error identify করুন।\" data-en=\"Identify denominator and grain errors.\">Identify denominator and grain errors.</span></li></ul></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-1\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">01</div><h2 data-bn=\"Metric-এর আগে question\" data-en=\"Question before metric\">Question before metric</h2><p data-bn=\"Decision ও user দিয়ে শুরু করুন: কে act করবে, কী choice এবং কোন evidence choice বদলাবে? তারপর descriptive, diagnostic, predictive বা causal question define করুন। “Dashboard build” deliverable, analytical question নয়।\" data-en=\"Begin with the decision and user: who will act, what choice is being made, and what evidence would change the choice? Then define descriptive, diagnostic, predictive, or causal questions. “Build a dashboard” is a deliverable, not an analytical question.\">Begin with the decision and user: who will act, what choice is being made, and what evidence would change the choice? Then define descriptive, diagnostic, predictive, or causal questions. “Build a dashboard” is a deliverable, not an analytical question.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-2\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">02</div><h2 data-bn=\"Metric specification\" data-en=\"Metric specification\">Metric specification</h2><p data-bn=\"Reproducible metric name, purpose, grain, numerator, denominator, inclusion/exclusion rule, time window, unit, source, refresh timing, owner ও limitation specify করে। Eligible visitor ও conversion event define না করলে “conversion rate” incomplete।\" data-en=\"A reproducible metric specifies name, purpose, grain, numerator, denominator, inclusion and exclusion rules, time window, unit, source, refresh timing, owner, and known limitations. “Conversion rate” is incomplete until an eligible visitor and conversion event are defined.\">A reproducible metric specifies name, purpose, grain, numerator, denominator, inclusion and exclusion rules, time window, unit, source, refresh timing, owner, and known limitations. “Conversion rate” is incomplete until an eligible visitor and conversion event are defined.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-3\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">03</div><h2 data-bn=\"Output, outcome ও driver\" data-en=\"Output, outcome, and driver\">Output, outcome, and driver</h2><p data-bn=\"Output delivered activity count করে, outcome desired change এবং driver result influence করা factor। Training session delivered output; skill improvement outcome; attendance ও practice driver হতে পারে। এদের mix করলে conclusion দুর্বল হয়।\" data-en=\"Outputs count activities delivered, outcomes represent desired changes, and drivers are factors believed to influence results. Training sessions delivered is an output; skill improvement is an outcome; attendance and practice may be drivers. Mixing them leads to weak conclusions.\">Outputs count activities delivered, outcomes represent desired changes, and drivers are factors believed to influence results. Training sessions delivered is an output; skill improvement is an outcome; attendance and practice may be drivers. Mixing them leads to weak conclusions.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-4\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">04</div><h2 data-bn=\"Comparison ও context\" data-en=\"Comparisons and context\">Comparisons and context</h2><p data-bn=\"Metric-এর context প্রয়োজন: target, prior period, benchmark, segment বা control group। 12% conversion channel, product, season ও eligibility অনুযায়ী excellent বা poor। Definition বা population change করা comparison এড়ান।\" data-en=\"A metric needs context: target, prior period, benchmark, segment, or control group. A 12% conversion rate may be excellent or poor depending on channel, product, season, and eligibility. Avoid comparisons that change definitions or populations.\">A metric needs context: target, prior period, benchmark, segment, or control group. A 12% conversion rate may be excellent or poor depending on channel, product, season, and eligibility. Avoid comparisons that change definitions or populations.</p></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section key-terms\" id=\"key-terms\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Vocabulary</div><h2 data-bn=\"গুরুত্বপূর্ণ শব্দ\" data-en=\"Key terms\">Key terms</h2><div class=\"term-grid\"><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Metric\" data-en=\"Metric\">Metric</h3><p data-bn=\"কিছু monitor বা evaluate করার defined quantitative measure।\" data-en=\"A defined quantitative measure used to monitor or evaluate something.\">A defined quantitative measure used to monitor or evaluate something.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Grain\" data-en=\"Grain\">Grain</h3><p data-bn=\"এক row বা metric event-এর represented level।\" data-en=\"The level represented by one row or metric event.\">The level represented by one row or metric event.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Numerator\" data-en=\"Numerator\">Numerator</h3><p data-bn=\"Division-এর উপরের counted বা summed quantity।\" data-en=\"The counted or summed quantity above the division line.\">The counted or summed quantity above the division line.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Denominator\" data-en=\"Denominator\">Denominator</h3><p data-bn=\"Rate বা proportion calculate করার eligible base।\" data-en=\"The eligible base used to calculate a rate or proportion.\">The eligible base used to calculate a rate or proportion.</p></article></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section worked-example\" id=\"worked-example\">\n<div class=\"section-kicker\">Example</div><h2 data-bn=\"On-time delivery rate define\" data-en=\"Defining an on-time delivery rate\">Defining an on-time delivery rate</h2><p class=\"example-context\" data-bn=\"Operations delivery performance improve হয়েছে কি না জানতে চায়।\" data-en=\"Operations wants to know whether delivery performance improved.\">Operations wants to know whether delivery performance improved.</p>\n<ol class=\"worked-steps\"><li><span>1</span><p data-bn=\"Eligible delivered order define ও cancelled order exclude করুন।\" data-en=\"Define eligible delivered orders and exclude cancelled orders.\">Define eligible delivered orders and exclude cancelled orders.</p></li><li><span>2</span><p data-bn=\"On-time define: promised timestamp-এর আগে বা সময়ে delivered।\" data-en=\"Define on-time: delivered on or before promised timestamp.\">Define on-time: delivered on or before promised timestamp.</p></li><li><span>3</span><p data-bn=\"Numerator: on-time eligible order।\" data-en=\"Numerator: eligible orders delivered on time.\">Numerator: eligible orders delivered on time.</p></li><li><span>4</span><p data-bn=\"Denominator: সব eligible delivered order।\" data-en=\"Denominator: all eligible delivered orders.\">Denominator: all eligible delivered orders.</p></li><li><span>5</span><p data-bn=\"Timezone, period, order grain, source ও comparison period specify করুন।\" data-en=\"Specify timezone, period, order grain, data source, and comparison period.\">Specify timezone, period, order grain, data source, and comparison period.</p></li></ol>\n<div class=\"example-conclusion\"><strong data-bn=\"Conclusion\" data-en=\"Conclusion\">Conclusion</strong><p data-bn=\"Metric এখন reproduce ও audit করা যায়; team অনুযায়ী different interpretation হবে না।\" data-en=\"The metric can now be reproduced and audited instead of interpreted differently by each team.\">The metric can now be reproduced and audited instead of interpreted differently by each team.</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section try-it-section\" id=\"try-it\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Try it yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"ধারণাটি প্র্যাকটিস করুন\" data-en=\"Practice the idea\">Practice the idea</h2><div id=\"tutorial-activity\"></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section exercise-section\" id=\"exercises\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Check yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"Chapter exercise\" data-en=\"Chapter exercises\">Chapter exercises</h2><div id=\"chapter-exercises\"></div><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/exercises/data-foundations/\">Open the complete exercise library →</a></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section recap-section\" id=\"summary\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Summary</div><h2 data-bn=\"যা মনে রাখবেন\" data-en=\"What to remember\">What to remember</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"Chart নয়, decision থেকে শুরু করুন।\" data-en=\"Start from a decision, not a chart.\">Start from a decision, not a chart.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Metric-এর complete business definition প্রয়োজন।\" data-en=\"Metrics require complete business definitions.\">Metrics require complete business definitions.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Rate-এর explicit denominator প্রয়োজন।\" data-en=\"Rates require explicit denominators.\">Rates require explicit denominators.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Comparison-এ definition ও population preserve করতে হয়।\" data-en=\"Comparisons must preserve definitions and populations.\">Comparisons must preserve definitions and populations.</span></li></ul></section>\n<details class=\"tutorial-references\"><summary>Authoritative references</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://nvlpubs.nist.gov/nistpubs/SpecialPublications/1500-18/NIST.SP.1500-18r2.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NIST Research Data Framework ↗</a></li><li><a href=\"https://ukdataservice.ac.uk/help/new-users/data-documentation/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">UK Data Service — Data Documentation ↗</a></li></ul></details>\n<div class=\"tutorial-complete-panel\"><div><h2 data-bn=\"পরবর্তী chapter-এর জন্য প্রস্তুত?\" data-en=\"Ready for the next chapter?\">Ready for the next chapter?</h2><p data-bn=\"ধারণাটি explain ও exercise finish করতে পারলে chapter complete mark করুন।\" data-en=\"Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.\">Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.</p></div><button class=\"button primary\" id=\"chapter-complete-bottom\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav class=\"tutorial-pager\"><a class=\"tutorial-prev\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/frequency-tables-and-summary-views/\"><small>← Previous</small><strong data-bn=\"Frequency Table ও Summary View\" data-en=\"Frequency Tables and Summary Views\">Frequency Tables and Summary Views</strong></a><a class=\"tutorial-next\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/exploratory-data-analysis-workflow/\"><small>Next →</small><strong data-bn=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\" data-en=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\">Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow</strong></a></nav>\n</article>\n</div></main>","scripts":["/assets/js/tutorial-core.js","/assets/js/tutorial.js"],"inlineScripts":[]}